@page
@model HydroSentinel.Pages.ProductModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "HydroSentinel Product"; }

<div class="page-redesign product-page">
    <section class="rd-section rd-hero" aria-labelledby="product-title"><div class="shell rd-hero-grid"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Smart water pump controller</p><h1 id="product-title">HydroSentinel</h1><p class="rd-hero-lede"><strong>Intelligent. Reliable. Built for you.</strong><br/>A practical control layer intended to help people understand their water-pumping systems and make more informed management decisions.</p><div class="rd-actions"><a class="button button-primary" asp-page="/Contact">Get Started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Firmlon</a></div></div><figure class="rd-hero-media"><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Installation.png" alt="HydroSentinel controller installed beside a blue water tank and pump" width="1672" height="941" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/></figure></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="product-overview"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Product overview</p><h2 id="product-overview">A controller designed for the system around it.</h2><p>HydroSentinel is intended to sit between the everyday reality of a pump, tank, and water supply and the people responsible for keeping that system working well.</p><p>It is part of the system, not a substitute for suitable installation, maintenance, or professional guidance. The product experience is designed around useful visibility and practical water-management conversations.</p><a class="text-link" asp-page="/HowItWorks">See the intended workflow <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><figure class="rd-editorial-media"><img src="~/images/pump-installation.jfif" alt="Industrial pump-room infrastructure showing pumps and pipework" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Contextual pump-system imagery; not a photograph of HydroSentinel hardware.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-soft" aria-labelledby="product-capabilities"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Capability areas</p><h2 id="product-capabilities">Built around useful signals.</h2></div><p>These are the product capabilities currently described in the approved project content.</p></div><div class="rd-feature-strip"><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="13" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 20h5m-2-5v5m9-8.5V20h-4.5v-8.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Z"/></svg></span><h3>Monitor</h3><p>Review intended water-level, pump-status, and system information.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 3 8 3v5c0 4.8-3.4 8.2-8 10-4.6-1.8-8-5.2-8-10V6l8-3Z"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"/></svg></span><h3>Protect</h3><p>Help make conditions that may need attention easier to notice.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5C9.6 7.1 6 10.9 6 14.6a6 6 0 0 0 12 0c0-3.7-3.6-7.5-6-11.1Z"/><path d="M9.5 16.5a3.2 3.2 0 0 0 3.2 2.3"/></svg></span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Use a clearer view to support everyday water-management decisions.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h13m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></span><h3>Connect</h3><p>Keep the intended user experience connected to the physical system.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="product-specs"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Product information</p><h2 id="product-specs">Technical details should be confirmed, not assumed.</h2><p>The current project does not approve values for voltage, connectivity, enclosure rating, operating temperature, or pump capacity. They are intentionally omitted rather than presented as facts.</p><div class="rd-note">Specification review required: ask Firmlon for the latest approved product documentation before making a purchasing or installation decision.</div></div><div class="rd-editorial-aside"><p class="rd-kicker">What is confirmed here</p><div class="rd-rule-list"><div class="rd-rule"><strong>01</strong><div><h3>Product identity</h3><p>HydroSentinel is Firmlon's smart water pump controller.</p></div></div><div class="rd-rule"><strong>02</strong><div><h3>Intended role</h3><p>It supports clearer monitoring, pump awareness, and water-system management.</p></div></div><div class="rd-rule"><strong>03</strong><div><h3>Live connection</h3><p>No live device telemetry or hardware communication is implemented in this website task.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-dark"><div class="shell rd-cta-row"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Product enquiries</p><h2>Talk through your installation.</h2><p class="rd-dark-copy">Share your context with Firmlon and ask which product information is relevant to your system.</p></div><div class="rd-actions"><a class="button button-light" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Firmlon</a><a class="button button-light-outline" asp-page="/Pricing">Explore Plans</a></div></div></section>
</div>
